  <p class="eyebrow">Next on the wrist · Wear OS</p>
  <h2 id="watch-heading">D2FA Watch <span class="status-badge">In development</span></h2>
  <p>An offline authenticator for Wear OS. The current MVP lets you create a vault, add accounts manually and generate TOTP codes directly on your watch.</p>
  <p>We're working towards managing accounts on your computer and securely transferring selected ones to the watch, without cloud sync. That transfer workflow is still being designed.</p>
  <p><strong>Desktop-2FA remains free and open source.</strong> The Watch app is planned as a separate paid app.</p>
  <p class="muted">The Watch app is in development; there is no download available here yet.</p>
</section>
